  "Built on trust since 1995.": ["Built on trust since 1995.","Dibina atas kepercayaan sejak 1995.","自 1995 年起，以信任为本。"],
  "What began as a small family business grew from a simple aim: offer quality pre-owned cars at fair prices and treat every customer with care.": ["What began as a small family business grew from a simple aim: offer quality pre-owned cars at fair prices and treat every customer with care.","Perniagaan keluarga kecil ini bermula dengan matlamat yang ringkas: menawarkan kereta terpakai berkualiti pada harga berpatutan dan melayan setiap pelanggan dengan baik.","我们从一家小型家族车行起步，目标很简单：以合理价格提供优质二手车，用心对待每一位客户。"],
  "For more than 30 years, Seng Guan Auto has focused on transparency, integrity and customer satisfaction. Founded by Ang Kin Guan, the business continues with his sons and the values it started with: honesty, quality and putting people first.": ["For more than 30 years, Seng Guan Auto has focused on transparency, integrity and customer satisfaction. Founded by Ang Kin Guan, the business continues with his sons and the values it started with: honesty, quality and putting people first.","Selama lebih 30 tahun, Seng Guan Auto mengutamakan ketelusan, integriti dan kepuasan pelanggan. Diasaskan oleh Ang Kin Guan, perniagaan ini diteruskan bersama anak-anak lelakinya dengan nilai yang sama: kejujuran, kualiti dan mengutamakan pelanggan.","三十多年来，Seng Guan Auto 始终重视透明、诚信和客户满意度。车行由 Ang Kin Guan 创立，如今由他和儿子们共同延续诚信、品质与以人为本的经营理念。"],
  "Visit our Banting showroom": ["Visit our Banting showroom","Lawati bilik pameran kami di Banting","到访我们的万津展厅"],
  "What guides us": ["What guides us","Panduan kami","我们的原则"],
  "Our core values.": ["Our core values.","Nilai teras kami.","我们的核心价值。"],
  "Simple principles shape how we prepare cars and work with the people who visit us.": ["Simple principles shape how we prepare cars and work with the people who visit us.","Prinsip ini membimbing cara kami menyediakan kereta dan melayani setiap pelanggan yang berkunjung.","这些原则指引我们如何准备车辆，以及如何接待到访的客户。"],
  "Integrity": ["Integrity","Integriti","诚信"],
  "We believe in honest, transparent dealings at every step.": ["We believe in honest, transparent dealings at every step.","Kami berurusan secara jujur dan telus pada setiap langkah.","每一步，我们都坚持诚实透明。"],
  "Quality": ["Quality","Kualiti","品质"],
  "We inspect vehicles before offering them for sale.": ["We inspect vehicles before offering them for sale.","Kami memeriksa kenderaan sebelum ditawarkan untuk jualan.","车辆出售前，我们会先进行检查。"],
  "Customer first": ["Customer first","Pelanggan diutamakan","客户优先"],
  "We listen to what matters to you and help you make an informed choice.": ["We listen to what matters to you and help you make an informed choice.","Kami mendengar keutamaan anda dan membantu anda membuat pilihan berdasarkan maklumat yang jelas.","我们先了解您在意的事项，再提供清楚的资料，帮助您作出选择。"],
  "Trust": ["Trust","Kepercayaan","信任"],
  "We work to earn confidence through dependable service over time.": ["We work to earn confidence through dependable service over time.","Kami membina kepercayaan melalui perkhidmatan yang boleh diharapkan dari semasa ke semasa.","我们以长期可靠的服务赢得信任。"],
  "The people behind the business": ["The people behind the business","Orang di sebalik perniagaan ini","车行背后的团队"],
  "Meet our team.": ["Meet our team.","Kenali pasukan kami.","认识我们的团队。"],
  "Local knowledge and experience, built over many years in Banting.": ["Local knowledge and experience, built over many years in Banting.","Pengetahuan tempatan dan pengalaman yang dibina bertahun-tahun di Banting.","多年扎根万津，熟悉本地市场，也积累了丰富经验。"],
