  "Talk with the team about the details that matter for the car you have in mind.": ["Talk with the team about the details that matter for the car you have in mind.","Bincang dengan pasukan kami tentang butiran penting untuk kereta yang anda minati.","和团队聊聊您看中的车，确认对您重要的细节。"],
