  "Check your inputs: enter a price, a smaller down payment, a non-negative rate, and a term from 1 to 9 years.": ["Check your inputs: enter a price, a smaller down payment, a non-negative rate, and a term from 1 to 9 years.","Semak input: masukkan harga, wang pendahuluan yang lebih rendah, kadar faedah sifar atau lebih, dan tempoh 1 hingga 9 tahun.","请检查输入：填写车价、低于车价的首付、不小于零的利率，以及 1 至 9 年的贷款期限。"],
  "Estimated loan amount: {amount} · {term} years": ["Estimated loan amount: {amount} · {term} years","Anggaran jumlah pinjaman: {amount} · {term} tahun","预估贷款金额：{amount} · {term} 年"],
