  "Operations Director": ["Operations Director","Pengarah Operasi","运营总监"],
  "With over 30 years in the automotive industry, Mr. Ang founded Seng Guan Auto with a vision to transform the used car buying experience in Malaysia.": ["With over 30 years in the automotive industry, Mr. Ang founded Seng Guan Auto with a vision to transform the used car buying experience in Malaysia.","Dengan pengalaman lebih 30 tahun dalam industri automotif, Encik Ang menubuhkan Seng Guan Auto untuk memperbaik pengalaman membeli kereta terpakai di Malaysia.","Ang 先生在汽车行业深耕三十多年。他创立 Seng Guan Auto，希望改善马来西亚消费者购买二手车的体验。"],
  "John oversees daily operations and ensures that every vehicle meets our strict quality standards before reaching our showroom floor.": ["John oversees daily operations and ensures that every vehicle meets our strict quality standards before reaching our showroom floor.","John menyelia operasi harian dan memastikan setiap kenderaan memenuhi piawaian kualiti kami sebelum dipamerkan.","John 负责日常运营，确保每辆车在进入展厅前都符合我们的质量标准。"],
  "Zi Wei leads our sales team with a customer-first approach, focusing on understanding client needs rather than pushing for quick sales.": ["Zi Wei leads our sales team with a customer-first approach, focusing on understanding client needs rather than pushing for quick sales.","Zi Wei mengetuai pasukan jualan dan mengutamakan pemahaman terhadap keperluan setiap pelanggan.","Zi Wei 带领销售团队，把了解客户的实际需要放在首位。"],
  "Vehicles": ["Vehicles","Kenderaan","车辆"],
  "Services": ["Services","Perkhidmatan","服务"],
  "Warranty": ["Warranty","Waranti","保修"],
  "What vehicles are featured on this site?": ["What vehicles are featured on this site?","Apakah kenderaan yang ditampilkan di laman web ini?","这个网站展示哪些车辆？"],
  "This site features a selection of vehicles from Seng Guan Auto. Click a vehicle to see its photos, specifications, price and description. Contact our team to confirm availability.": ["This site features a selection of vehicles from Seng Guan Auto. Click a vehicle to see its photos, specifications, price and description. Contact our team to confirm availability.","Laman ini memaparkan kenderaan pilihan Seng Guan Auto. Pilih kenderaan untuk melihat gambar, spesifikasi, harga dan penerangannya. Hubungi kami untuk mengesahkan ketersediaan.","本站展示 Seng Guan Auto 的精选车辆。点击车辆即可查看照片、规格、价格及介绍。请联系团队确认车辆是否仍可购买。"],
  "Contact the dealership by phone or WhatsApp to ask about the vehicle you are interested in and arrange a suitable time.": ["Contact the dealership by phone or WhatsApp to ask about the vehicle you are interested in and arrange a suitable time.","Hubungi pengedar melalui telefon atau WhatsApp untuk bertanya tentang kenderaan pilihan anda dan menetapkan masa yang sesuai.","请通过电话或 WhatsApp 联系车行，咨询您感兴趣的车辆并预约合适的时间。"],
  "Can I estimate a monthly payment?": ["Can I estimate a monthly payment?","Bolehkah saya menganggarkan bayaran bulanan?","我可以估算每月还款吗？"],
  "Use the on-page calculator to create an illustrative estimate from the car price, down payment, rate, and loan term you enter. Confirm actual rates and terms with the dealership and finance provider.": ["Use the on-page calculator to create an illustrative estimate from the car price, down payment, rate, and loan term you enter. Confirm actual rates and terms with the dealership and finance provider.","Gunakan kalkulator di laman ini untuk menganggarkan bayaran berdasarkan harga kereta, wang pendahuluan, kadar faedah dan tempoh pinjaman. Sahkan kadar dan terma sebenar dengan pengedar dan penyedia pembiayaan.","用本站计算器输入车价、首付、利率和贷款期限，即可试算。实际利率和条款请向车行及贷款机构确认。"],
  "What documents might I need?": ["What documents might I need?","Apakah dokumen yang mungkin diperlukan?","我可能需要准备哪些文件？"],
  "Common requirements include identity, driving licence, and income or employment documents. Ask the team which documents apply to your situation.": ["Common requirements include identity, driving licence, and income or employment documents. Ask the team which documents apply to your situation.","Dokumen lazim termasuk pengenalan diri, lesen memandu serta bukti pendapatan atau pekerjaan. Tanya pasukan kami tentang dokumen yang diperlukan untuk situasi anda.","通常需要身份证明、驾驶执照及收入或就业证明。请向团队确认您的情况需要哪些文件。"],
  "How long does loan approval take?": ["How long does loan approval take?","Berapa lama kelulusan pinjaman mengambil masa?","贷款审批需要多久？"],
  "Timing depends on the finance provider and application. Contact the team for guidance on a specific vehicle and application.": ["Timing depends on the finance provider and application. Contact the team for guidance on a specific vehicle and application.","Tempohnya bergantung pada penyedia pembiayaan dan permohonan. Hubungi kami untuk panduan bagi kenderaan dan permohonan tertentu.","审批时间视贷款机构和申请情况而定。请联系我们，了解您所选车辆和申请的具体情况。"],
  "Can you help with insurance and registration?": ["Can you help with insurance and registration?","Bolehkah anda membantu dengan insurans dan pendaftaran?","你们可以协助办理保险和注册吗？"],
  "Our team can help with vehicle registration and insurance. Confirm the steps and any fees before proceeding.": ["Our team can help with vehicle registration and insurance. Confirm the steps and any fees before proceeding.","Pasukan kami boleh membantu dengan pendaftaran dan insurans kenderaan. Sahkan langkah dan sebarang fi sebelum meneruskan.","团队可以协助办理车辆注册和保险。请在办理前确认流程及相关费用。"],
  "Can I ask about a trade-in?": ["Can I ask about a trade-in?","Bolehkah saya bertanya tentang tukar beli?","我可以咨询旧车置换吗？"],
  "Contact the dealership with your current vehicle details to discuss whether a trade-in can be considered.": ["Contact the dealership with your current vehicle details to discuss whether a trade-in can be considered.","Hubungi pengedar dengan butiran kenderaan semasa anda untuk berbincang tentang kemungkinan tukar beli.","请提供您现有车辆的资料，与车行确认是否可以置换。"],
  "What warranty applies to a specific car?": ["What warranty applies to a specific car?","Apakah waranti yang terpakai pada kereta tertentu?","某辆车适用什么保修？"],
  "Coverage may depend on the vehicle and the policy. Ask for the written terms for that vehicle before making a decision.": ["Coverage may depend on the vehicle and the policy. Ask for the written terms for that vehicle before making a decision.","Perlindungan mungkin bergantung pada kenderaan dan polisi. Minta terma bertulis bagi kenderaan itu sebelum membuat keputusan.","保修范围视车辆及保修条款而定。决定前，请索取该车辆的书面条款。"],
